[0;34m==>[0m Part 6: Production Monitoring Recommendations
[0;36m→[0m For production, consider setting up:

  1. Prometheus - Time-series metrics database
     • Scrape /metrics endpoint every 15s
     • Store 30 days of data

  2. Grafana - Visualization and dashboards
     • Create NestGate dashboard
     • Set up alert panels

  3. Alert Manager - Alert routing
     • High error rate alerts
     • High latency alerts
     • Disk space alerts

  4. Logging - ELK/Loki stack
     • Centralized log aggregation
     • Log-based alerts

[0;36m→[0m Example Prometheus config:
    
    scrape_configs:
      - job_name: 'nestgate'
        static_configs:
          - targets: ['localhost:8080']
        metrics_path: '/metrics'
        scrape_interval: 15s

