Key Insight: Monitor everything! You can't fix what you can't measure.

Typical monitoring intervals:
  • Health checks: Every 5-10 seconds
  • Metrics scraping: Every 15-30 seconds
  • Log aggregation: Real-time streaming
  • Alerts: Evaluated every 1-5 minutes

